# Review ownership.
#
# The paths below are the ones where a wrong change is expensive to detect
# later, so they are listed explicitly rather than left to the default rule.
# When this repository moves to an organisation, replace the individual handle
# with the team that holds each obligation — the paths and the reasons for
# them do not change.

* @Kikanmened

# Statistical behaviour. A change here retroactively alters the meaning of
# every historical number (QUALITY_ASSURANCE_PLAN.md §6), so review is not
# optional and the pull request must state the impact on existing baselines.
/src/spc_platform/analytics/ @Kikanmened
/tests/statistical/          @Kikanmened
/docs/validation/            @Kikanmened

# The domain vocabulary, where the SpecificationLimit / ControlLimit
# separation is enforced by construction.
/src/spc_platform/domain/ @Kikanmened

# Reference data and control plans are quality records, not settings.
/data/reference/ @Kikanmened
/configs/        @Kikanmened

# The gates themselves. Weakening a gate is a change to what "green" means.
/.github/                @Kikanmened
/scripts/ci/             @Kikanmened
/Makefile                @Kikanmened
/pyproject.toml          @Kikanmened
/uv.lock                 @Kikanmened
/.importlinter           @Kikanmened
/.pre-commit-config.yaml @Kikanmened
/.gitleaks.toml          @Kikanmened

# Source-of-truth documents and the rules that direct the AI contributor.
/docs/          @Kikanmened
/.cursor/rules/ @Kikanmened
